An '''unnamed island''' in the [[Orange Islands]] appears in ''[[EP092|The Joy of Pokémon]]''. According to [[Pocket Monsters Film Comic]], it is a deserted island considered to be a part of [[Kinnow Island]].

A particularly athletic and tanned [[Nurse Joy]] operates the local [[Pokémon Center]]. She also services a number of surrounding islands, rowing from island to island with her {{TP|Nurse Joy|Chansey}} to help sick or injured Pokémon because most of the [[Orange Islands]] are too small to have Pokémon Centers.

